## Module structure

Each module under `module/<module>/` is a self-contained vertical slice:

```
module/<module>/
├── api/                    ← public surface (controllers, DTOs, events)
│   ├── <Module>Controller.java
│   ├── <Module>Dto.java
│   └── <Module>Events.java
└── internal/               ← internal implementation (entity, repo, service)
    ├── <Module>.java
    ├── <Module>Repository.java
    └── <Module>Service.java
```

- `api/` — The module's public contract. Other modules MAY depend on this.
- `internal/` — Private implementation. Other modules MUST NOT import from here.

